                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "\ud83d\udce3 Friendly Reminder: Just 2 Days Until Our Medicaid Town Hall in Greenbelt!\n\nJoin us Wednesday, July 30, from 10\u202fAM to 12\u202fPM, as I sit down with @SenatorATW, Delegates Ashanti Martinez and Nicole Williams in Greenbelt to celebrate Medicaid\u2019s 60-year legacy\u2014and dig into what this legislation really means for our community.\n\nYour voice matters: bring your questions, stories, feedback. We want a real conversation\u2014not just a briefing.\n\n\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f RSVP here: https://t.co/cirwz17jVg\n\nTogether, let's ensure Medicaid continues to serve people\u2014not get sacrificed for tax breaks benefiting the wealthy.",
