                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 A potential government shutdown is just hours away as Congress remains deadlocked on funding.\nWhile essential services will continue, programs many rely on \u2014 like benefits, healthcare, and travel support \u2014 could face serious disruptions.\n\ud83d\udcc5 Join me for a Government Shutdown Webinar on Wednesday, Oct. 1 at 5:00 PM to learn how this may affect you.\n\ud83d\udc49 Register here: https://t.co/Tn4ec9mkXA",
